"01 / About me": "01 / 关于我",
"PhD researcher working on forest fire early warning and numerical weather prediction.": "从事森林火灾早期预警与数值天气预报研究的博士研究生。",
"PROFILE": "简介",
"Bio": "个人简介",
"I am a PhD researcher at the Centre of Excellence in Disaster Mitigation and Management (CoEDMM), Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee. My thesis develops an early warning system for forest fire events over the Indian Himalayan Region.": "我是 Centre of Excellence in Disaster Mitigation and Management (CoEDMM), Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee 的博士研究生。我的论文旨在为印度喜马拉雅地区的森林火灾事件建立早期预警系统。",
"The work combines numerical weather prediction models with observational and reanalysis datasets. I also work on tropical cyclones and on disasters induced by climate change.": "研究将数值天气预报模式与观测资料和再分析资料相结合。我也研究热带气旋以及气候变化引发的灾害。",
"As part of my PMRF deliverables and science communication, I conduct and organise workshops, science communication lectures and other lectures at universities and colleges across India. The topics include the application of numerical weather prediction models, including the WRF model, followed by programming and data analysis with Python, R and Origin Pro, disaster mitigation and management, climate change, and wildfire spread and analysis using geospatial and other computational tools.": "作为 PMRF 任务和科学传播工作的一部分，我在印度各地的大学和学院开展并组织研讨会、科学传播讲座及其他讲座。主题包括数值天气预报模式（含 WRF 模式）的应用，随后是使用 Python、R 和 Origin Pro 的编程与数据分析、灾害减缓与管理、气候变化，以及借助地理空间及其他计算工具开展的野火蔓延与分析。",
